# Interview Explanation

> "We deployed the monitoring solution using the kube-prometheus-stack Helm chart. It automatically installed Prometheus, Grafana, Alertmanager, Prometheus Operator, kube-state-metrics, and Node Exporter. We enabled Spring Boot Actuator to expose application metrics and created a PodMonitor so Prometheus could scrape them. We then defined alert conditions using PrometheusRule resources. Finally, we configured Alertmanager with Gmail SMTP using an App Password. Whenever an alert condition is met, Prometheus sends the alert to Alertmanager, which delivers an email notification through the configured SMTP server."